It is often wise not to wish for anything when you don't really need
something right now, and keep the wand for emergencies (for example,
when you blow up your bag of holding and lose your candles).

> I know I must spend one wish on something to recharge the wand
> with, so I thought a magic marker rather than scrolls of
> charging.

Do this only when you've already found and identified at least one
scroll of charging, or you'll only have a chance of succeeding.

