The Eye is a terrible miss. Your mana now regenerates much more slowly
and keeping a stack is also much more cumbersome... Magicbane would also
have been nice for the curse absorption, but Stormbringer isn't much of
a loss, I think.

Note that there's a guaranteed wand of death later on, with Orcus. Try
to manoeuver in such a way that it still has some charges left after you
take it from him.

> I'm also sleep, fire, poison, and cold resistant, I have
> telepathy, teleportis and teleport control, and I see
